{"results":[{"url":"https://arkadecrown-borivali.in","title":"Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road | 2 and 3 BHK at Borivali West","raw_content":"* [Floor Plan](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Price](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Gallery](#gallery)\n\n![Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road  Banner](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/1783150849.jpg)\n\n![Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road  Banner](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/1783150839.jpg)\n\nMahaRERA Website\n\n [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/) \n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![A51700026634](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![P51800045342](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/qr/Arkade-Crown-QR-P51800045342_-04072026080628.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. A51700026634\n\n[![A51700026634](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. P51800045342\n\n[![P51800045342](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/qr/Arkade-Crown-QR-P51800045342_-04072026080628.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road  Banner](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/1783150849.jpg)\n\n![Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road  Banner](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/1783150839.jpg)\n\nFor Best Offers Fill Your Details\n\n![Arkade Group Developer](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/1678871226.svg)\n\nArkade Group\n\nDeveloper\n\n![S.V.P. Road, Borivali West Location](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/1678871255.svg)\n\nS.V.P. Road, Borivali West\n\nLocation\n\n# About Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road Project\n\n**Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road** is a Project by **Arkade Group** situated in the most premium location of **Borivali West**, S.V.P. Road, offers **2 and 3 BHK** Flats with the availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities & Specifications. Arkade Crown Borivali Westhas an Exclusive Tower of 3 Wings A, B & C with a floor range of**22 Storeys**.\n\nArkade Crown by Arkade Group offers 2 BHK apartments starts from 748 Sqft carpet area and 3 BHK apartments starts from 1064 – 1289 Sqft carpet area. Arkade Crown MahaRERA Number **P51800045342.**\n\nArkade Crown Arkade Group Borivali West Property Features **Amenities** like Sitting Plaza, Multipurpose Play Court, and Basketball Court, Reflexology Path, Bird Houses, Walking Track, Kid's Play Area, Kid's Indoor Activity, Toddler Area, Party Lawn, Banquet Area, Outdoor Gym, Fragrant Plants, Lawn Mounds, Yoga/Zumba, Gym, Assembly Area, Pergola. Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road Has **Excellent Connectivity** Karuna Hospital - 550 M, Lotus Multispeciality Hospital - 1.1 Km, Seatherny Hospital - 1.1 Km, M.M. Hospital - 1.5 Km, S.E. International School - 350 M, St.Francis D’ Assisi Jr College - 650 M, Samajonnati College - 800 M, Rustomjee Cambridge International School - 850 M, School of Environment & Architecture - 1.8 Km, Don Bosco Junior College - 2.2 Km, Vstar Mall - 1 Km, The Zone Mall - 1.4 Km, Reliance Mall - 2 Km.\n\nArkade Crown **address** is Arkade Crown, Junction of Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel Road & Devidas Lane Borivali (West), Mumbai - 400103.\n\n**Arkade Group** has many ongoing, upcoming & completed Projects Arkade Nest, Arkade Prime, Arkade Aura, Arkade Crown, Arkade Rise, Arkade Serene, Arkade Art, Arkade Adornia, Bhoomi Arkade, and Arkade Earth.\n\n![Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road_ Elevation Image](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/image1783150761.jpg)\n\n## Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road Overview\n\n![Project Name](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/image1729333292.svg)\n\nProject Name\n\nArkade Crown\n\n![Location](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/image1729333246.svg)\n\nLocation\n\nS.V.P. 