-Floor-Plan-Wing-C\n\n## Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road Gallery\n\n### Elevation Images\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Elevation-Back-View](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Elevation-Back-View-04072026080228.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Gallery-Elevation-Back-View\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Elevation-Eye-View](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Elevation-Eye-View-04072026080318.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Gallery-Elevation-Eye-View\n\n### Sample Flat Photos\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Living-Room](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Living-Room-04072026080022.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Gallery-Living-Room\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Kitchen](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Kitchen-04072026080042.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Gallery-Kitchen\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Master-Bedroom](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Master-Bedroom-04072026080057.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Gallery-Master-Bedroom\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Guest-Bedroom](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Guest-Bedroom-04072026080114.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Gallery-Guest-Bedroom\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Kids-Bedroom](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Kids-Bedroom-04072026080133.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Gallery-Kids-Bedroom\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Dining-Area](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Gallery-Dining-Area-04072026080150.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Gallery-Dining-Area\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Amenities-Amphitheatre](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Amenities-Amphitheatre-04072026080211.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Amenities-Amphitheatre\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Amenities-Gym](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Amenities-Gym-04072026080244.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Amenities-Gym\n\n![Arkade-Crown-Amenities-Multipurpose-Lawn](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Crown-Amenities-Multipurpose-Lawn-04072026080300.jpg)\n\nArkade-Crown-Amenities-Multipurpose-Lawn\n\n#### External Amenities\n\n* Sitting Plaza\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Basketball Court\n* Reflexology Path\n* Bird Houses\n* Walking Track\n* Kid's Play Area\n* Kid's Indoor Activity\n* Toddler Area\n* Party Lawn\n* Banquet Area\n* Outdoor Gym\n* Fragrant Plants\n* Lawn Mounds\n* Yoga/Zumba\n* Gym\n* Assembly Area\n* Pergola\n\n#### Internal Features\n\n* Vitrified Tiles for Living, Dining, Kitchen & Bedrooms\n* Vitrified Tiles for Bathroom Flooring & Dado\n* Wash Basin Counters\n* Vitrified Tile Dado 2'0\" high above Kitchen platform\n* Kitchen platform with SS sink & Drain board\n\n## Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road Walkthrough Video\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![image](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/Arkade-Developer-favicon_-04072026080501.png)\n\n## Arkade Group\n\nAt **Arkade Group**, there is more to us than what meets the eye. What was started as a passionate drive to craft abodes by Shri Mangilal R. Jain in 1984 has now turned into much more than just that. Led by people who believe in the power of passion and leaps of faith, we have become Life Investors, multiplying life & providing contentment.\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n### Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road Construction Status\n\n## Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road Location\n\n## Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road Sales Gallery / Office Address & Experience Center\n\nArkade Crown, Junction of Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel Road & Devidas Lane Borivali (West), Mumbai – 400103.\n\n## Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road MahaRera\n\n[![P51800045342](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/qr/Arkade-Crown-QR-P51800045342_-04072026080628.png)](javascript:void(0);) \n\nP51800045342\n\nThe website project is registered under  [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\n[What types of homes are available at Arkade Crown, S.V.P. Road?](#collapse0)\n\nArkade Crown offers 2 and 3 BHK homes ranging from Carpet 748 – 1289 Sqft.\n\n[What amenities are provided at Arkade Crown, S.V.P. Road?](#collapse1)\n\nThe project includes over 25 amenities such as a Sitting Plaza, Multipurpose Play Court, and Basketball Court, Reflexology Path, Bird Houses, Walking Track, Kid's Play Area, Kid's Indoor Activity, Toddler Area, Party Lawn, Banquet Area, Outdoor Gym, Fragrant Plants, Lawn Mounds, Yoga/Zumba, Gym, Assembly Area, Pergola and more.\n\n[What is the location advantage of Arkade Crown, S.V.P. Road?](#collapse2)\n\nLocated Nearby Karuna Hospital - 550 M, Lotus Multispeciality Hospital - 1.1 Km, Seatherny Hospital - 1.1 Km, M.M. Hospital - 1.5 Km, S.E. International School - 350 M, St.Francis D’ Assisi Jr College - 650 M, Samajonnati College - 800 M, Rustomjee Cambridge International School - 850 M, School of Environment & Architecture - 1.8 Km, Don Bosco Junior College - 2.2 Km, Vstar Mall - 1 Km, The Zone Mall - 1.4 Km, Reliance Mall - 2 Km, the property offers excellent connectivity.\n\n[Is Arkade Crown, S.V.P. Road, a RERA-registered project?](#collapse3)\n\nYes, Arkade Crown is an RERA-authorized project with MahaRERA number P51800045342.\n\n[![Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road ](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583) \n\n[![Arkade Crown S.V.P. Road ](https://arkadecrown-borivali.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583)  The information provided on this website is intended exclusively for informational purposes and should not be construed as an offer of services. This site is managed by a RERA authorized real estate agent namely Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited (Registered Agent bearing RERA No: A51700026634).\n\nThis website is a digital promotional showcase managed by\n\n#### **Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited**,\n\nan independent, MahaRERA-registered real estate agent bearing\n\n#### **MahaRERA Real Estate Agent Registration No. A51700026634**.\n\nThe project showcased herein, **\"Arkade Crown Project\"**, is a registered real estate project developed by Arkade Group, bearing **MahaRERA Project Registration Number: P51800045342**. All project-related particulars, including specifications, configurations, dynamic floor plans, and layout designs, are provided for consumer awareness and initial guidance.\n\nThe text, representations, layout diagrams, and computer-generated mockups or images used on this portal are artist impressions and are indicative only. The final terms, pricing structure, dynamic stock availability, and specific project timelines are subject to change as per the promoter/developer’s updates or market modifications. In strict alignment with the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 (RERA), all buyers are encouraged to independently verify all verified files, sanctioned building plans, and project progress statuses on the official MahaRERA website at <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in> under the registered project number before making any booking or financial commitment.\n\nDigipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited functions purely as an authorized sourcing/facilitating partner and shall not be held liable for any unilateral alterations made by the developer to the underlying layout or project construct.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/arkade-crown-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235333332353537","title":"Arkade Crown in Borivali West, Mumbai: Price, Brochure, Floor Plan, Reviews","raw_content":"![video of Arkade Crown](https://img.youtube.com/vi_webp/p5gwGi_sFW0/hqdefault.webp \"video of Arkade Crown\")\n![image of Arkade Crown](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/projec